escription_plaintext":"No. Compressing your PDFs with Smallpdf doesn’t alter fonts in any way. Your document fonts will remain consistent and unaffected by the compression process. This means all text styles, sizes, and embedded fonts are fully preserved, maintaining the PDF’s professional appearance."},{"_uid":"166a74a0-b41d-45a6-8617-3592403fefe3","title":"Is the compress tool safe to use?","component":"BodyFAQItem","description":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":" ","type":"text"}]}]},"description_plaintext":"We’re committed to safety and security. In addition to GDPR compliance, Smallpdf is ISO/IEC 27001-certified, undergoes annual security audits, and employs TLS encryption to keep your files safe."},{"_uid":"fa7ea2a0-2319-4b6b-a983-13855b427c22","title":"Can I compress PDFs on the go?","component":"BodyFAQItem","description_plaintext":"Yes, our iOS and Android mobile apps let you compress large PDF files on the go, so you can stay productive while traveling or working remotely."},{"_uid":"8751cd0e-e386-471c-9d4e-3ffdef792db1","title":"What is the best online PDF compressor?","component":"BodyFAQItem","description_plaintext":"The best PDF compressor shrinks file size without losing quality. Smallpdf’s Compress PDF tool does just that—offering fast, high-quality compression with “Basic”, “Moderate”, and “Strong” options. Plus, the compressor comes with TLS encryption, GDPR compliance, and ISO/IEC 27001 certification. Try it for free—no sign-up needed!"},{"_uid":"e198a232-a01b-4875-bc52-8449b750ea2c","title":"How does PDF compression work?","component":"BodyFAQItem","description_plaintext":"Smallpdf’s PDF compressor analyzes your document, removes redundant data, and re-encodes large images to shrink file size—without sacrificing quality. It’s fast and efficient, and it keeps your content intact."},{"_uid":"d75fa58d-7245-40f3-a6e9-ab4cc906ac63","title":"How do I reduce the size of a poster?","component":"BodyFAQItem","description":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Text","type":"text"}]}]},"description_plaintext":"You can compress your poster as a PDF file using Smallpdf's Compress PDF. This shrinks the file size while keeping the design and text as clear as possible. You can also scale down the poster's dimensions using your computer's print settings by printing to PDF and selecting a smaller paper size."},{"_uid":"f6968a7a-b467-405a-9827-e4395f7d9226","title":"Why use Compress PDF to reduce the size of your resume?","component":"BodyFAQItem","description":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Text","type":"text"}]}]},"description_plaintext":"When you're applying for jobs, your resume file size can become a problem. Many job application portals have file size limits, and if your PDF resume is too large, it might not upload. That's where Smallpdf's PDF compressor comes in."},{"_uid":"1dceb60c-34f0-416a-a810-04d6a4227641","title":"How do I reduce a scanned PDF file size?","component":"BodyFAQItem","description":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"text":"Text","type":"text"}]}]},"description_plaintext":"Start with a tool like Smallpdf's Compress PDF. It's fast, easy, and built for image-heavy documents, such as scans. You upload, pick your compression level, and boom, lighter file, no loss of quality."}],"title":"PDF Compressing FAQs","actions":[{"_uid":"a8d1456e-16c3-4652-94d5-807a9f299f45","link":{"id":"","url":"https://smallpdf.com/support","linktype":"url","fieldtype":"multilink","cached_url":"https://smallpdf.com/support"},"label":"More FAQs","layout":"primary","component":"LinkButton","open_in_new_tab":true}],"component":"BodyFAQ","description":""},{"_uid":"8ab169a2-44df-4514-bb45-9dda4f58a0c7","items":[{"_uid":"724a633a-36dc-42f4-8f5c-f44b51b4d327","href":"https://smallpdf.com/blog/reduce-pdf-file-size-below-100-kb","asset":{"id":3719586,"alt":"Blog header of a blog article on how to compress PDFs to 100 KB.","n