j22sv-2 dkDtTb">Fast &amp; Effective PDF Compressor</h3><p class="sc-1wj22sv-3 kfvDgj">Compress your PDF effortlessly and instantly. Simply drag and drop your file, and our compressor will automatically optimize it within seconds. Enjoy seamless online compression across all major platforms: Mac, Windows, Linux, iOS, and Android.</p><div class="sc-1wj22sv-4 kVyLsq"></div></div><div class="sc-1wj22sv-5 iNoxwa"><img alt="A shrinking PDF showcasing Smallpdf’s Compress PDF tool options" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/x/884c595ea1/220902_flexiblecompression.svg" loading="lazy" width="600" height="520" class="sc-1w0ts1v-0 kdKtXD"></div></div><div class="sc-1wj22sv-0 dDlShA"><div class="sc-1wj22sv-1 hdWRXa"><h3 class="sc-1wj22sv-2 dkDtTb">Smaller PDFs, Same High Quality</h3><p class="sc-1wj22sv-3 kfvDgj">Select between Basic, Moderate, and Strong PDF compression for the optimal balance. Reduce file size without noticeable quality loss.</p><div class="sc-1wj22sv-4 kVyLsq"></div></div><div class="sc-1wj22sv-5 iNoxwa"><img alt="Compress PDF works by removing repetitive patterns to shrink your PDF." src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/x/2e05c5fd83/220902_howtocompression.svg" loading="lazy" width="600" height="520" class="sc-1w0ts1v-0 kdKtXD"></div></div><div class="sc-1wj22sv-0 dDlShA"><div class="sc-1wj22sv-1 hdWRXa"><h3 class="sc-1wj22sv-2 dkDtTb">Secure Compression, Trusted Worldwide</h3><p class="sc-1wj22sv-3 kfvDgj">Your PDFs are secured with TLS encryption, comply with GDPR, and are ISO/IEC 27001-certified. For extra peace of mind, we automatically delete files after one hour.</p><div class="sc-1wj22sv-4 kVyLsq"></div></div><div class="sc-1wj22sv-5 iNoxwa"><img alt="Securely sharing a compressed PDF from any device" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/x/cffa26245f/220902_easysharing.svg" loading="lazy" width="600" height="520" class="sc-1w0ts1v-0 kdKtXD"></div></div></div><div class="sc-1oo6ywp-0 bTfRKz"><div class="sc-1oo6ywp-1 gMbpKq"><div class="sc-1oo6ywp-2 eVzsJz"><h2 class="sc-1oo6ywp-3 bcWLZP">How To Compress a PDF Online for Free</h2><ol class="sc-1oo6ywp-4 bWvMJE"><li class="sc-1oo6ywp-5 hdEWoO"><span class="sc-1oo6ywp-6 hmFNPo">Drag &amp; drop your file into Smallpdf’s free PDF compressor.</span></li><li class="sc-1oo6ywp-5 hdEWoO"><span class="sc-1oo6ywp-6 hmFNPo">Choose Basic, Moderate (Pro), or Strong (Pro) compression, then click ‘Compress’.</span></li><li class="sc-1oo6ywp-5 hdEWoO"><span class="sc-1oo6ywp-6 hmFNPo">If needed, edit your PDF with our other tools.</span></li><li class="sc-1oo6ywp-5 hdEWoO"><span class="sc-1oo6ywp-6 hmFNPo">Download or share your compressed PDF when you’re done.</span></li></ol></div><div class="sc-1oo6ywp-8 lkZoBP"><img src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/1382x784/dda4eb54ca/compress-pdf-how-to-steps.png" alt="How to compress a PDF: drag and drop the file, choose a compression level, and download or share the result" loading="lazy" class="nikv54-0 bWHXDm"></div></div></div><div class="pvbp07-0 dIVlso"><div class="s0ug8l-0 fJhegd"><h2 class="s0ug8l-1 fAnqAF">Everything You Need in a PDF Compressor</h2></div><ul class="sc-1e1pg54-0 fOReMX"><li class="o7qeou-0 jHVxWt"><div class="o7qeou-1 iqDlMW"><span class="o7qeou-2 dqoiGP"><img alt="" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/150x150/cb7b34b6fe/speed.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" class="sc-1e33vuf-0 faQvxH"></span><h3 class="o7qeou-3 hQiurv">Compress Immediately—No Installation</h3></div><div class="o7qeou-4 ebdTos">Compress PDFs directly in your browser—no installations, sign-ups, or learning curves. Just upload, compress, and be on your way.</div></li><li class="o7qeou-0 jHVxWt"><div class="o7qeou-1 iqDlMW"><span class="o7qeou-2 dqoiGP"><img alt="" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/150x150/8990e4b38a/device.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" class="sc-1e33vuf-0 faQvxH"></span><h3 class="o7qeou-3 hQiurv">Compress PDFs on Any Device</h3></div><div class="o7qeou-4 ebdTos">Smallpdf’s tools are cloud-based, so you can reduce your file size online via any browser and on any device, from desktop to tablet and mobile.</div></li><li class="o7qeou-0 jHVxWt"><div class="o7qeou-1 iqDlMW"><span class="o7qeou-2 dqoiGP"><img alt="" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/150x150/f7ab6d7cc4/documents.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" class="sc-1e33vuf-0 faQvxH"></span><h3 class="o7qeou-3 hQiurv">Compress PDFs &amp; Other File Formats</h3></div><div class="o7qeou-4 ebdTos">Compress more than just PDFs. Use the tool to reduce other file types, such as Word, PPT, Excel, JPG, PNG, GIF, and TIFF.</div></li><li class="o7qeou-0 jHVxWt"><div class="o7qeou-1 iqDlMW"><span class="o7qeou-2 dqoiGP"><img alt="" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/150x150/6f40d5e265/shield.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" class="sc-1e33vuf-0 faQvxH"></span><h3 class="o7qeou-3 hQiurv">GDPR Compliance</h3></div><div class="o7qeou-4 ebdTos">Smallpdf is GDPR-compliant, which means we’re transparent about how we collect, store, and process your personal data.</div></li><li class="o7qeou-0 jHVxWt"><div class="o7qeou-1 iqDlMW"><span class="o7qeou-2 dqoiGP"><img alt="" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/150x150/7bfb845a02/certificate.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" class="sc-1e33vuf-0 faQvxH"></span><h3 class="o7qeou-3 hQiurv">ISO/IEC 27001 Certified Security</h3></div><div class="o7qeou-4 ebdTos">We’re ISO/IEC 27001 certified, so we’re audited annually to ensure the safety, security, and integrity of your documents.</div></li><li class="o7qeou-0 jHVxWt"><div class="o7qeou-1 iqDlMW"><span class="o7qeou-2 dqoiGP"><img alt="" src="https://s.smallpdf.com/static/cms/f/102628/150x150/b0e399a76f/lock-eye.svg" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" class="sc-1e33vuf-0 faQvxH"></span><h3 class="o7qeou-3 hQiurv">File Transfer Encryption</h3></div><div class="o7qeou-4 ebdTos">Smallpdf keeps your documents secure, even while you’re working on them, with state-of-the-art TLS encryption.</div></li></ul><div class="sc-17euhj1-0 jWcjdv"><div class="sc-17euhj1-1 jztdLb"></div></div></div><div class="pvbp07-0 dIVlso"><div class="s0ug8l-0 fJhegd"><h2 class="s0ug8l-1 fAnqAF">PDF Compressing FAQs</h2></div><ul class="sc-1j9ovnz-0 doNwod"><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details open=""><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">Is Smallpdf’s PDF compressor free to use?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">Absolutely! Our PDF compressor is free for reducing file size, like our other tools. You can also compress MS Office files, as well as JPG, PNG, GIF, TIFF, and other image formats, without quality loss. Note that usage limits may apply, and our “Moderate” and “Strong” compression are Pro features. To begin, drag and drop your files into the PDF compressor above.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">Can I compress PDFs with my whole team?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">Yes! Our Smallpdf for Teams plan provides unlimited PDF compression for your team. Enjoy 40+ PDF tools (edit, merge, convert, including AI) and flexible payment options for teams of any size.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">Will compression affect fonts or document quality?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">No. Compressing your PDFs with Smallpdf doesn’t alter fonts in any way. Your document fonts will remain consistent and unaffected by the compression process. This means all text styles, sizes, and embedded fonts are fully preserved, maintaining the PDF’s professional appearance.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">Is the compress tool safe to use?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">We’re committed to safety and security. In addition to GDPR compliance, Smallpdf is ISO/IEC 27001-certified, undergoes annual security audits, and employs TLS encryption to keep your files safe.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">Can I compress PDFs on the go?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">Yes, our iOS and Android mobile apps let you compress large PDF files on the go, so you can stay productive while traveling or working remotely.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">What is the best online PDF compressor?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">The best PDF compressor shrinks file size without losing quality. Smallpdf’s Compress PDF tool does just that—offering fast, high-quality compression with “Basic”, “Moderate”, and “Strong” options. Plus, the compressor comes with TLS encryption, GDPR compliance, and ISO/IEC 27001 certification. Try it for free—no sign-up needed!</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">How does PDF compression work?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">Smallpdf’s PDF compressor analyzes your document, removes redundant data, and re-encodes large images to shrink file size—without sacrificing quality. It’s fast and efficient, and it keeps your content intact.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">How do I reduce the size of a poster?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">You can compress your poster as a PDF file using Smallpdf's Compress PDF. This shrinks the file size while keeping the design and text as clear as possible. You can also scale down the poster's dimensions using your computer's print settings by printing to PDF and selecting a smaller paper size.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">Why use Compress PDF to reduce the size of your resume?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">When you're applying for jobs, your resume file size can become a problem. Many job application portals have file size limits, and if your PDF resume is too large, it might not upload. That's where Smallpdf's PDF compressor comes in.</p></details></li><li class="sc-11o5f5t-0 hWwvJQ"><details><summary class="sc-11o5f5t-1 jjycsV"><h3 class="sc-11o5f5t-2 egVeAz">How do I reduce a scanned PDF file size?</h3><span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-11o5f5t-3 iSnKRX"><div class="sc-1gyxcpm-0 eUwonh" style="width:24px;height:24px" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="m17 9 1 1-6 6-6-6 1-1 5 5.17z"></path></svg></div></span></summary><p class="sc-11o5f5t-4 jJDsAe">Start with a tool like Smallpdf's Compress PDF. It's fast, easy, and built for image-heavy documents, such as scans. You upload, pick your compression level, and boom, lighter file, no loss of quality.</p></details></li></ul><div class="sc-17euhj1-0 jWcjdv"><div class="sc-17euhj1-1 jztdLb"><div class="dhh33n-0 kSubXE"><a class="sc-1bu7qfl-0 bGbCKV sc-1az4ycp-1 keUaVK" target="_blank" href="https://smallpdf.com/support"><div aria-hidden="false" tabindex="-1" class="r5zwp6-